{'symbol': 'NI', 'date': '2021-03-16 16:20:00', 'title': 'NISOURCE DECLARES COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'MERRILLVILLE, IND., MARCH 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NISOURCE INC. (NYSE: NI) TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF 22 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE MAY 20, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON APRIL 30, 2021.'}